                                "sense_id": "f3981304-b285-3ec4-8b4b-9d896c216c1a",
                                "text": "the late ruine of proud Marinell, and suddein parture of faire Florimell"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cefea50d-f5a4-4b65-9c57-5a27cd35ba55",
                                "sense_id": "f3981304-b285-3ec4-8b4b-9d896c216c1a",
                                "text": "If I should now forget, or not remember thee,\nThou, Spencer, mightest a foule rebuke and shame impute to mee;\nFor I to open shew did loue thee passing well,\nAnd thou wert he at parture whom I loathed to bid farewell;"
